{{!--
  mapping.handlebars
  ==================
  Renders a single mapping section: source entities, target, and
  the attribute-level mapping between them.

  Context: a Mapping object (iterated from datamodel.mappings)

  Available properties:
    id                        – Mapping identifier
    sources[]                 – Source objects
      .id                     – Source alias used in conditions/expressions
      .entity                 – Reference to source LogicalEntity (resolved)
      .entity._globalId       – Fully qualified: "DataModel.Entity"
      .join                   – "from", "inner-join", "left-join", etc.
      .conditions[]           – Join conditions (BinaryExpression)
    target                    – Target object
      .entity                 – Reference to target LogicalEntity (resolved)
      .mappings[]             – Attribute mappings
        .attribute.value      – Target attribute (resolved)
        .sources[].value      – Source attribute(s) (resolved)
        .expressions[]        – Computed expressions (.language, .expression)
--}}
<h2 id="mapping-{{id}}">Mapping: {{id}}</h2>

### Sources

| Alias | Entity | Join | Conditions |
|:------|:-------|:-----|:-----------|
{{#each sources}}
| **{{id}}** | `{{#if entity}}{{entity._globalId}}{{/if}}` | {{#if join}}`{{join}}`{{/if}} | {{#each conditions}}{{expression.left.value.id}} {{expression.op}} {{expression.right.value.id}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} |
{{/each}}

{{#if target}}
### Target → [{{#if target.entity}}{{target.entity.name}}{{/if}}](#{{#if target.entity}}{{target.entity.id}}{{/if}})

{{#each target.mappings}}
{{#if @first}}
| Target Attribute | Source(s) | Expression |
|:-----------------|:----------|:-----------|
{{/if}}
| {{#if attribute}}**{{attribute.value.name}}**{{/if}} | {{#each sources}}{{value.id}}{{#unless @last}}, {{/unless}}{{/each}} | {{#each expressions}}`{{{expression}}}` *({{language}})*{{#unless @last}} {{/unless}}{{/each}} |
{{/each}}
{{/if}}

---

